Demo_Hub_Well0=The old well at the square has been quiet for as long as anyone remembers.
Demo_Hub_Well1=Villagers murmur about strange sounds from the well after your last visit.
Demo_Hub_Well2=The murmurs have turned to whispers. Something is stirring beneath {townname}.
Demo_Hub_Well3=The town is on edge. Whatever lives in the well is close to the surface now.
