Demo_Well_Title=The Old Well
Demo_Well_Flavor1=The water is ice cold tonight.
Demo_Well_Flavor2=A frog watches you from the mossy rim.
Demo_Well_Flavor3=The echo takes far too long to return.
Demo_Well_Encounter1=The bucket comes up empty, but the rope is oddly warm.
Demo_Well_Encounter2=A coin glints at the bottom of the well. You toss in another for luck.
Demo_Well_Encounter3=Something brushes against the bucket in the dark water below.
Demo_Well_Silent=The well is silent today.
Demo_Well_Checkpoint=Visited the well

Demo_Rumors_Title=Whispers in Town
Demo_Rumor1=They say the mayor never sleeps.
Demo_Rumor2=Someone heard laughter from the empty chapel.
Demo_Rumor3=The miller swears his flour has gone missing again.

